(FLEET PROCUREMENT PROCEDURE - SPARE PARTS) Tj T*
(Procedure PRO-12, effective 1 February 2026) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Approval limits) Tj T*
(Purchase orders up to 2,000 USD may be approved by the Technical Superintendent. Orders) Tj T*
(above 2,000 USD and up to 10,000 USD require the approval of the Fleet Manager. Orders above) Tj T*
(10,000 USD require the approval of the Technical Director. An order must never be split to) Tj T*
(stay under an approval limit.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Quotations) Tj T*
(For orders with a value above 5,000 USD, at least 3 written quotations must be obtained from) Tj T*
(approved suppliers. For orders of 5,000 USD or less, a single quotation from an approved) Tj T*
(supplier is sufficient.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Critical spares) Tj T*
(Parts marked with criticality class C in the catalogue are critical spares: a vessel must) Tj T*
(never be without at least one on board. If the stock on board falls below the minimum level,) Tj T*
(the part must be re-ordered at once and no quotation comparison is required.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Emergency purchases) Tj T*
(When a vessel is unable to sail or safety is affected, the Master or the Technical) Tj T*
(Superintendent may approve an emergency purchase by phone. The approval must be ratified in) Tj T*
(writing within 24 hours. Emergency purchases are exempt from the quotation requirement but) Tj T*
(not from the approval limits.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Delivery and receipt) Tj T*
(Parts are delivered to the vessel's next port of call or to the agent nominated by the) Tj T*
(Superintendent. The receiving officer must check the delivery against the purchase order) Tj T*
(within 48 hours and report any shortage or damage to Fleet Procurement. Claims for damage in) Tj T*
(transit are not accepted after 7 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Documentation) Tj T*
(Every purchase order must record the part number from the catalogue, the supplier code, the) Tj T*
(unit price in USD and the vessel name. Prices in other currencies must be converted at the) Tj T*
(rate published by Finance on the day the order is raised.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
